offline
- an update shows as a dot on the menu button and a first item in the menu, and on the About
  page (/about: version, check for updates, install, offline, storage) (src/js/app-update.ts: a
  new worker waits, the page reloads only when the user chooses). Left: a slim "A new version is
  ready: Reload / Later" bar on pages that are not a setlist. Another window of the app that a
  new worker takes over keeps its old code until reloaded: not handled. Idea for About: a list
  of the errors and CSP violations seen on this device, with a Copy button, for a device whose
  DevTools are awkward (a ChromeOS tablet).

